<title>USA: China Resources Development Q1 shr falls.</title>
<headline>China Resources Development Q1 shr falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amounts in thousands, except share and per share data)</p>
<p>							 Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						     March 31,</p>
<p>					    1997	 1996	 1997</p>
<p>					  RMB	  RMB	   US$(a)</p>
<p> Sales				  109,398    255,120     13,181</p>
<p> Net income			     3,381	2,496	  407</p>
<p> Earnings per share(b)		 0.60	 1.73	 0.07</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>common and common stock</p>
<p>equivalent shares outstanding(b)</p>
<p>					5,673,186  1,439,683  5,673,186</p>
<p>NOTE - (a)  Based on an exchange rate of U.S. $1.00=Rmb8.30 on March 31, 1997. Amounts have been converted from Renminbi to U.S. dollars for convenience only.</p>
<p>(b)  Adjusted for a one-for-ten reverse stock split of the Company's outstanding common stock that was effective on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
